{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54608","headline":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天数日，半雨半兼（川本作「无」）晴。\n营内有奸谋结叛，先晴後雨叛难成（京本作「擒」），先雨後晴兴（京本作「兵」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}